# Implementation Plan - Phase 50: Unblocking Outcome Dashboard

## Goal
Resolve the `TypeError: Metaclasses with custom tp_new are not supported` error preventing [app.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/app.py) (Flask Backend) from running. This blocker prevents verification of the Outcome Dashboard (Phase 8b).

## Strategy
Switch the local runtime from **Python 3.14** (Default, broken with Protobuf) to **Python 3.11** (Verified working with Marketing Autopilot).

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Environment Setup
- [ ] Install [requirements.txt](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/requirements.txt) dependencies into the `python3.11` environment.
  - `python3.11 -m pip install -r requirements.txt`

### 2. Code Adjustments (If needed)
- [ ] Monitor [app.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/app.py) startup for any Python version-specific syntax issues or missing environment variables.
- [ ] Ensure [llm_client.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/runtime/llm_client.py) Legacy Fallback is active (already validated).

### 3. Verification Script
- [ ] Create `scripts/verify_app_startup.py`:
  - Attempts to start [app.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/app.py) in a thread or subprocess.
  - Pings `http://localhost:5055/health` (or root).
  - Shuts down after success.

## Verification Plan

### Automated
- Run `python3.11 scripts/verify_app_startup.py`.

### Manual
1. Start server: `python3.11 app.py`
2. Open Nucleus HUD (`http://localhost:3000`).
3. Create a dummy assessment in the "Outcome Dashboard" widget.
4. Verify data persists and graph updates.
